	measure 'Estimated Productivity Rate Initial to FollowupDFD' = ```
			/*VAR __Resp = [SuperScore Respondents]
			VAR __Prod = [Estimated Total Absent Hours (in last 30days)]
			RETURN
			calculate( DIVIDE ( [Estimated Total Absent Hours (in last 30days)],[SuperScore Respondents] ))
			*/
			VAR _ini =
			    CALCULATE (
			        [Estimated Productivity RateDFD],
			        'FACT_EAP_SRVY_DTL'[Survey Type Name] = "Initial"
			    )
			VAR _Foll =
			    CALCULATE (
			        [Estimated Productivity RateDFD],
			        'FACT_EAP_SRVY_DTL'[Survey Type Name] = "Follow-Up"
			    )
			VAR _Total = ( _Foll - _ini )
			RETURN
			    DIVIDE ( _Total, _ini )
			
			
			
			
			```
